    "Id": "mechdef_aries_ARS-Prime",
    "Name": "Aries Prime",
    "Details": "This primary configuration features dual ER PPCs and ER Medium Lasers in both arms for strong energy damage. Two HAG/20 ballistic autocannons are mounted in the left and right torso, with ammo stored in the head, center torso, and right arm. Two iATM 9 missile launchers in the left and right torso provide versatile missile firepower, supported by ammo in both arms. This balanced configuration delivers powerful multi-range offense with ample ammunition. Cooling is managed by 17 double heat sinks for effective heat dissipation.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.19</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#0064e6>Used with permission from Aries Games and Miniatures.</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_aries"
  },
